# Zip / Photo Inputs Live in `upload/`

- Put photo zip archives and photo directories in the project `upload/` directory.
- CLI examples and docs should use paths like `upload/photos.zip` or `upload/vacation/`.
- Do not leave loose input zips at the repo root.
- Default GIF output (when `--output` is omitted) stays beside the input under `upload/`.
- Bare `./giffer` batch-processes `upload/` and skips sources that already have a matching `.gif`.
